  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF MANCHESTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"University of Manchester is a renowned public research university in Manchester, England, where Ben F. Spencer worked as a Research Fellow and conducted groundbreaking research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BEN F. SPENCER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ben F. Spencer is a distinguished researcher known for his contributions to advanced materials and nanotechnology, and his involvement in developing a novel nanomaterial with potential applications in renewable energy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MANCHESTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Manchester is the city where the University of Manchester is located, and where Ben F. Spencer spent a significant portion of his career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH FELLOW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Research Fellow is a position held by Ben F. Spencer at the University of Manchester, where he was responsible for mentoring students and collaborating with esteemed colleagues."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEPARTMENT OF PHYSICS AND ASTRONOMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DEPARTMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Department of Physics and Astronomy is the department where Ben F. Spencer worked as a Research Fellow at the University of Manchester."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF MATERIALS SCIENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Journal of Materials Science is a prestigious scientific journal where some of Ben F. Spencer's publications appeared."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NANOTECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nanotechnology is the field of research in which Ben F. Spencer focused, leading to several publications in scientific journals."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENGINEERING AND PHYSICAL SCIENCES RESEARCH COUNCIL (EPSRC)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"EPSRC is the funding body for Ben F. Spencer's research on a novel nanomaterial with potential applications in renewable energy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EDINBURGH NAPIER UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Edinburgh Napier University is another institution where Ben F. Spencer was involved in research on sustainable energy solutions for rural communities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIGHTHILL CAMPUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sighthill campus is the location of Edinburgh Napier University where Dr. Sophia Patel found the forgotten folder about Ben F. Spencer's research on sustainable energy harvesting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sighthill campus is the location of Edinburgh Napier University where Dr. Sophia Patel found the forgotten folder about Ben F. Spencer."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. SOPHIA PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Sophia Patel is a researcher at Edinburgh Napier University who discovers a forgotten folder about Ben F. Spencer's research on sustainable energy harvesting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MRS. MACTAVISH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mrs. MacTavish is an archivist at Edinburgh Napier University who provides insights about Ben F. Spencer's work and personality."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUSTAINABLE ENERGY HARVESTING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sustainable Energy Harvesting is the topic of Ben F. Spencer's research, which was ahead of its time and met with skepticism from university administrators."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RURAL COMMUNITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rural Communities is the target of the sustainable energy solutions developed by Ben F. Spencer and his team at Edinburgh Napier University."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY ARCHIVES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"University Archives is the repository where the forgotten folder about Ben F. Spencer's research was stored."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARCHIVE ROOM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Archive Room is the specific area in the basement of Edinburgh Napier University where the forgotten folder was found."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MANCHESTER MATTERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PUBLICATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Manchester Matters is the staff newsletter of the University of Manchester that featured an article about Ben F. Spencer's appointment as a Research Fellow."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2002 UNIVERSITY PRESS RELEASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PUBLICATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"2002 university press release is a document that showcased Ben F. Spencer's pioneering work on a novel nanomaterial with potential applications in renewable energy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2005 STUDENT EVALUATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVALUATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"2005 student evaluation is a document that praised Ben F. Spencer's ability to break down complex concepts into accessible, engaging lectures."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADVANCED MATERIALS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Advanced Materials is the specific area of research that Ben F. Spencer contributed to, leading to several publications in scientific journals."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RENEWABLE ENERGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Renewable Energy is the application area of Ben F. Spencer's research on a novel nanomaterial."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INNOVATIVE APPROACH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Innovative Approach is the term used to describe Ben F. Spencer's method of conducting research, which was recognized by the university press release."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATORS&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ben F. Spencer's actions have ruffled the feathers of the administrators, indicating a conflict or challenge to their authority."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOPHIA&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sophia is present during the discussion about Ben F. Spencer, suggesting she is aware of his work and reputation."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FORGOTTEN FOLDER&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
      <data key="d1">"The forgotten folder, once a relic, now holds new significance due to Ben F. Spencer's work, suggesting a direct link between his research and the folder's renewed importance."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAVERICK RESEARCHER&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ben F. Spencer is described as a maverick researcher, indicating his role and characteristics."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INNOVATION&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
      <data key="d1">"Maverick researchers are known for pushing the boundaries of innovation, highlighting their role in advancing new ideas."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BYGONE ERA&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
      <data key="d1">"The forgotten folder, a relic of a bygone era, now holds new significance due to Ben F. Spencer's innovative work, linking the past and present through innovation."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUSHING BOUNDARIES&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0388</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pushing boundaries is a key aspect of innovation, indicating the continuous effort to create new things."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
